  "description": "RIXBOR crystallizes in the triclinic crystal system with space group P -1. Reported CIF formula moiety: C226 H160 Ce6 N31 O34,7(C3 H7 N1 O1),3.5(H2 O1). From the CIF bond table, Ce1 (Ce) has 6 O neighbors; Ce2 (Ce) has 6 O neighbors; Ce3 (Ce) has 6 O neighbors; Ce4 (Ce) has 7 O neighbors; Ce5 (Ce) has 7 O neighbors; Ce6 (Ce) has 6 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 6 pairs, 2 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.680-3.895 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 98.95-115.25°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C247H215Ce6N38O44.5.",
